<BaseLayout locale="en" title="Privacy — 462019" description="Privacy information for 462019."><section class="account shell"><div class="eyebrow">Privacy</div><h1>Small by design.</h1><div class="card"><p>Guest visitors are not given a server account. Registered members provide a username, password hash, optional unverified email, favorites and language preference. No analytics, comments or public profiles are enabled.</p><p>Unverified email cannot recover an account. Members can delete their account after signing in.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>

